            <title>2.15</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:35:05 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.15</h2><p class="date">Release date: 10 Nov 2026</p><h3>New in 2.15</h3><ul><li>Connect several AI coding tools at once: a row of tool marks above the tabs switches between Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and Gemini CLI, and a right click stops monitoring one</li><li>Codex, Cursor and Gemini show the context of a session against the model window in the session card</li><li>Codex shows its own usage limit in the header</li><li>Fixed: the Codex mark was cut off at the bottom</li><li>Fixed: Indexing no longer flashes on every background scan, and the footer clock shows no seconds</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
